{"id":"forecast-11","section":4,"path":"bank/listening/forecast-11/audio-4.mp3","model":"small","duration":990.12,"segments":[{"start":0.05,"end":8.67,"text":"Part 4. You will hear part of a talk about recent research into the design of workplaces.","words":[["Part",0.05,0.63],["4.",0.63,1.09],["You",2.03,2.65],["will",2.65,2.83],["hear",2.83,3.17],["part",3.17,3.55],["of",3.55,3.75],["a",3.75,3.83],["talk",3.83,4.19],["about",4.19,4.73],["recent",4.73,5.37],["research",5.37,6.01],["into",6.01,6.73],["the",6.73,6.93],["design",6.93,7.49],["of",7.49,7.83],["workplaces.",7.83,8.67]]},{"start":9.63,"end":70.27,"text":"First, you have some time to look at questions 31 to 40. Now listen carefully and answer questions 31 to 40.","words":[["First,",9.63,10.51],["you",11.23,11.43],["have",11.43,11.61],["some",11.61,11.79],["time",11.79,12.15],["to",12.15,12.39],["look",12.39,12.51],["at",12.51,12.67],["questions",12.67,13.01],["31",13.01,13.99],["to",13.99,14.61],["40.",14.61,15.05],["Now",65.59,65.79],["listen",65.79,66.11],["carefully",66.11,66.63],["and",66.63,67.49],["answer",67.49,67.83],["questions",67.83,68.25],["31",68.25,69.25],["to",69.25,69.89],["40.",69.89,70.27]]},{"start":70.27,"end":80.69,"text":"Hello everyone. I recently completed some important research into the way office space is designed","words":[["Hello",70.27,71.33],["everyone.",74.05,74.61],["I",75.37,75.71],["recently",75.71,76.21],["completed",76.21,77.01],["some",77.01,77.25],["important",77.25,77.73],["research",77.73,78.31],["into",78.31,78.79],["the",78.79,78.97],["way",78.97,79.21],["office",79.21,79.59],["space",79.59,79.97],["is",79.97,80.23],["designed",80.23,80.69]]},{"start":80.69,"end":87.75,"text":"and its impact on employees. The Open Plan office had been the norm for offices around the world.","words":[["and",80.69,81.45],["its",81.45,81.69],["impact",81.69,82.15],["on",82.15,82.41],["employees.",82.41,82.99],["The",83.73,84.07],["Open",84.07,84.55],["Plan",84.55,84.99],["office",84.99,85.31],["had",85.31,85.61],["been",85.61,85.79],["the",85.79,85.91],["norm",85.91,86.19],["for",86.19,86.43],["offices",86.43,86.77],["around",86.77,87.17],["the",87.17,87.37],["world.",87.37,87.75]]},{"start":88.29,"end":94.65,"text":"I'm sure you can picture one. A big room with maybe 50 or 100 workers sitting at their work","words":[["I'm",88.29,88.63],["sure",88.63,88.91],["you",88.91,89.11],["can",89.11,89.25],["picture",89.25,89.53],["one.",89.53,89.85],["A",90.31,90.51],["big",90.51,90.69],["room",90.69,91.07],["with",91.07,91.41],["maybe",91.41,91.81],["50",91.81,92.33],["or",92.33,92.69],["100",92.69,93.15],["workers",93.15,93.69],["sitting",93.69,94.07],["at",94.07,94.27],["their",94.27,94.43],["work",94.43,94.65]]},{"start":94.65,"end":102.07,"text":"stations? You might think Open Plan designs are a recent phenomenon, but they actually came","words":[["stations?",94.65,95.11],["You",95.81,96.29],["might",96.29,96.65],["think",96.65,96.95],["Open",96.95,97.39],["Plan",97.39,97.77],["designs",97.77,98.13],["are",98.13,98.89],["a",98.89,99.01],["recent",99.01,99.43],["phenomenon,",99.43,99.97],["but",100.29,100.75],["they",100.75,101.11],["actually",101.11,101.71],["came",101.71,102.07]]},{"start":102.07,"end":108.45,"text":"about in the early 20th century when businesses needed large numbers of people to do typing.","words":[["about",102.07,102.37],["in",102.37,102.73],["the",102.73,102.83],["early",102.83,103.15],["20th",103.15,103.83],["century",103.83,104.27],["when",104.27,105.01],["businesses",105.01,105.57],["needed",105.57,105.99],["large",105.99,106.53],["numbers",106.53,107.03],["of",107.03,107.29],["people",107.29,107.65],["to",107.65,107.89],["do",107.89,108.05],["typing.",108.05,108.45]]},{"start":109.57,"end":115.87,"text":"These employees, usually women, used to have to sit in rows working away at their typewriters","words":[["These",109.57,110.03],["employees,",110.03,110.63],["usually",110.93,111.47],["women,",111.47,111.81],["used",112.35,112.69],["to",112.69,112.85],["have",112.85,112.97],["to",112.97,113.11],["sit",113.11,113.35],["in",113.35,113.53],["rows",113.53,113.91],["working",113.91,114.45],["away",114.45,114.85],["at",114.85,115.05],["their",115.05,115.17],["typewriters",115.17,115.87]]},{"start":115.87,"end":118.17,"text":"under the watchful eye of their supervisor.","words":[["under",115.87,116.53],["the",116.53,116.67],["watchful",116.67,117.11],["eye",117.11,117.35],["of",117.35,117.45],["their",117.45,117.61],["supervisor.",117.61,118.17]]},{"start":119.33,"end":124.65,"text":"Over the years, designers have come up with several variations on the open theme.","words":[["Over",119.33,119.69],["the",119.69,119.85],["years,",119.85,120.35],["designers",120.71,121.35],["have",121.35,121.63],["come",121.63,121.87],["up",121.87,121.99],["with",121.99,122.21],["several",122.21,122.65],["variations",122.65,123.37],["on",123.37,123.81],["the",123.81,123.93],["open",123.93,124.21],["theme.",124.21,124.65]]},{"start":125.39,"end":129.13,"text":"In particular, this has been achieved through furnishings.","words":[["In",125.39,125.63],["particular,",125.63,126.25],["this",126.65,126.87],["has",126.87,127.11],["been",127.11,127.31],["achieved",127.31,127.71],["through",127.71,128.07],["furnishings.",128.07,129.13]]},{"start":129.13,"end":132.63,"text":"The early designs featured separate desks.","words":[["The",129.13,129.87],["early",129.87,130.25],["designs",130.25,130.83],["featured",130.83,131.39],["separate",131.39,131.99],["desks.",131.99,132.63]]},{"start":133.31,"end":137.17,"text":"A subsequent design introduced the concept of the cubicle.","words":[["A",133.31,133.51],["subsequent",133.51,134.03],["design",134.03,134.59],["introduced",134.59,135.25],["the",135.25,135.63],["concept",135.63,136.23],["of",136.23,136.51],["the",136.51,136.65],["cubicle.",136.65,137.17]]},{"start":137.83,"end":142.07,"text":"These can have either high screens that workers can't see over","words":[["These",137.83,138.11],["can",138.11,138.63],["have",138.63,139.25],["either",139.25,139.59],["high",139.59,139.91],["screens",139.91,140.29],["that",140.29,140.73],["workers",140.73,141.15],["can't",141.15,141.63],["see",141.63,141.71],["over",141.71,142.07]]},{"start":142.07,"end":145.81,"text":"or a screen just low enough to keep a look out for the manager.","words":[["or",142.07,142.87],["a",142.87,143.09],["screen",143.09,143.41],["just",143.41,143.77],["low",143.77,144.09],["enough",144.09,144.31],["to",144.31,144.51],["keep",144.51,144.67],["a",144.67,144.81],["look",144.81,144.93],["out",144.93,145.15],["for",145.15,145.31],["the",145.31,145.41],["manager.",145.41,145.81]]},{"start":146.71,"end":150.59,"text":"Nowadays, with the increase in large call centres,","words":[["Nowadays,",146.71,147.47],["with",148.07,148.41],["the",148.41,148.51],["increase",148.51,148.99],["in",148.99,149.45],["large",149.45,149.85],["call",149.85,150.13],["centres,",150.13,150.59]]},{"start":151.27,"end":153.99,"text":"a phenomenon known as hot disking is common.","words":[["a",151.27,151.45],["phenomenon",151.45,151.75],["known",151.75,152.19],["as",152.19,152.45],["hot",152.45,152.79],["disking",152.79,153.25],["is",153.25,153.63],["common.",153.63,153.99]]},{"start":154.77,"end":158.19,"text":"In this system, employees working on different shifts","words":[["In",154.77,155.05],["this",155.05,155.33],["system,",155.33,155.87],["employees",156.07,156.57],["working",156.57,157.05],["on",157.05,157.27],["different",157.27,157.67],["shifts",157.67,158.19]]},{"start":158.19,"end":160.77,"text":"are asked to share the same workstation.","words":[["are",158.19,158.59],["asked",158.59,158.85],["to",158.85,159.05],["share",159.05,159.51],["the",159.51,159.77],["same",159.77,160.07],["workstation.",160.07,160.77]]},{"start":161.65,"end":164.95,"text":"As you can imagine, this is not very popular with staff","words":[["As",161.65,161.93],["you",161.93,162.07],["can",162.07,162.19],["imagine,",162.19,162.55],["this",162.93,163.09],["is",163.09,163.33],["not",163.33,163.57],["very",163.57,163.87],["popular",163.87,164.29],["with",164.29,164.61],["staff",164.61,164.95]]},{"start":164.95,"end":168.63,"text":"as there is little opportunity to personalise your workspace.","words":[["as",164.95,165.45],["there",165.45,165.63],["is",165.63,165.77],["little",165.77,166.11],["opportunity",166.11,166.77],["to",166.77,167.01],["personalise",167.01,168.01],["your",168.01,168.13],["workspace.",168.13,168.63]]},{"start":174.43,"end":178.75,"text":"In fact, my research shows that employees in general","words":[["In",174.43,174.73],["fact,",174.73,175.25],["my",175.77,176.07],["research",176.07,176.65],["shows",176.65,177.15],["that",177.15,177.39],["employees",177.39,177.93],["in",177.93,178.19],["general",178.19,178.75]]},{"start":178.75,"end":180.85,"text":"dislike the open-plan design.","words":[["dislike",178.75,179.25],["the",179.25,179.67],["open",179.67,179.93],["-plan",179.93,180.27],["design.",180.27,180.85]]},{"start":181.57,"end":183.23,"text":"As a part of my research,","words":[["As",181.57,181.93],["a",181.93,182.05],["part",182.05,182.33],["of",182.33,182.49],["my",182.49,182.63],["research,",182.63,183.23]]},{"start":183.43,"end":187.15,"text":"I conducted a survey of the staff in several large companies","words":[["I",183.43,183.73],["conducted",183.73,184.19],["a",184.19,184.45],["survey",184.45,184.77],["of",184.77,185.01],["the",185.01,185.17],["staff",185.17,185.53],["in",185.53,185.77],["several",185.77,186.21],["large",186.21,186.59],["companies",186.59,187.15]]},{"start":187.15,"end":188.79,"text":"with open-plan offices.","words":[["with",187.15,187.73],["open",187.73,188.03],["-plan",188.03,188.33],["offices.",188.33,188.79]]},{"start":188.79,"end":193.57,"text":"The employees all voiced similar concerns about the design.","words":[["The",188.79,189.99],["employees",189.99,190.55],["all",190.55,191.01],["voiced",191.01,191.47],["similar",191.47,191.95],["concerns",191.95,192.63],["about",192.63,192.93],["the",192.93,193.11],["design.",193.11,193.57]]},{"start":194.19,"end":197.83,"text":"Firstly, they felt that the open plan took away their privacy,","words":[["Firstly,",194.19,194.67],["they",195.07,195.21],["felt",195.21,195.51],["that",195.51,195.69],["the",195.69,195.79],["open",195.79,196.05],["plan",196.05,196.51],["took",196.51,196.83],["away",196.83,197.11],["their",197.11,197.33],["privacy,",197.33,197.83]]},{"start":198.47,"end":202.81,"text":"but many also felt the need to carry their valuables with them at all times.","words":[["but",198.47,198.77],["many",198.77,199.17],["also",199.17,199.55],["felt",199.55,199.89],["the",199.89,200.09],["need",200.09,200.25],["to",200.25,200.39],["carry",200.39,200.75],["their",200.75,200.99],["valuables",200.99,201.59],["with",201.59,201.83],["them",201.83,201.99],["at",201.99,202.09],["all",202.09,202.25],["times.",202.25,202.81]]},{"start":203.33,"end":207.99,"text":"So, to some extent, they also felt there was less security with these designs.","words":[["So,",203.33,203.71],["to",203.85,203.97],["some",203.97,204.29],["extent,",204.29,204.69],["they",204.97,205.13],["also",205.13,205.45],["felt",205.45,205.87],["there",205.87,206.05],["was",206.05,206.15],["less",206.15,206.41],["security",206.41,206.99],["with",206.99,207.31],["these",207.31,207.49],["designs.",207.49,207.99]]},{"start":208.93,"end":212.69,"text":"Another common complaint may be something for employers to consider","words":[["Another",208.93,209.49],["common",209.49,209.79],["complaint",209.79,210.35],["may",210.35,210.67],["be",210.67,210.87],["something",210.87,211.11],["for",211.11,211.45],["employers",211.45,211.95],["to",211.95,212.17],["consider",212.17,212.69]]},{"start":212.69,"end":214.87,"text":"when choosing this type of design,","words":[["when",212.69,213.33],["choosing",213.33,213.77],["this",213.77,214.09],["type",214.09,214.33],["of",214.33,214.45],["design,",214.45,214.87]]},{"start":214.87,"end":220.73,"text":"and this was that these types of office space are bad for the health. I was","words":[["and",214.87,215.61],["this",215.61,216.07],["was",216.07,216.25],["that",216.25,216.51],["these",216.51,216.79],["types",216.79,217.31],["of",217.31,217.55],["office",217.55,217.81],["space",217.81,218.19],["are",218.19,218.57],["bad",218.57,218.81],["for",218.81,219.01],["the",219.01,219.13],["health.",219.13,219.53],["I",220.09,220.49],["was",220.49,220.73]]},{"start":220.73,"end":225.95,"text":"intrigued by this possibility but looking at staff records it does seem to be","words":[["intrigued",220.73,221.23],["by",221.23,221.53],["this",221.53,221.71],["possibility",221.71,222.29],["but",222.29,222.71],["looking",222.71,223.53],["at",223.53,223.75],["staff",223.75,224.03],["records",224.03,224.65],["it",224.65,225.01],["does",225.01,225.29],["seem",225.29,225.65],["to",225.65,225.83],["be",225.83,225.95]]},{"start":225.95,"end":232.27,"text":"borne out. So if this design is so unpopular why is it so commonplace?","words":[["borne",225.95,226.29],["out.",226.29,226.57],["So",227.73,228.21],["if",228.21,228.69],["this",228.69,228.95],["design",228.95,229.41],["is",229.41,229.63],["so",229.63,229.85],["unpopular",229.85,230.41],["why",230.41,231.07],["is",231.07,231.25],["it",231.25,231.37],["so",231.37,231.57],["commonplace?",231.57,232.27]]},{"start":233.13,"end":237.85,"text":"Well the answer to that is in the benefits that the employers feel this","words":[["Well",233.13,233.47],["the",233.47,233.97],["answer",233.97,234.29],["to",234.29,234.47],["that",234.47,234.77],["is",234.77,235.19],["in",235.19,235.51],["the",235.51,235.65],["benefits",235.65,236.09],["that",236.09,236.41],["the",236.41,236.53],["employers",236.53,237.09],["feel",237.09,237.53],["this",237.53,237.85]]},{"start":237.85,"end":243.11,"text":"type of design has. Of course there is the obvious benefit that this design","words":[["type",237.85,238.17],["of",238.17,238.29],["design",238.29,238.59],["has.",238.59,239.17],["Of",239.79,240.11],["course",240.11,240.35],["there",240.35,240.83],["is",240.83,240.99],["the",240.99,241.15],["obvious",241.15,241.55],["benefit",241.55,242.05],["that",242.05,242.37],["this",242.37,242.59],["design",242.59,243.11]]},{"start":243.11,"end":250.37,"text":"significantly reduces costs, both in terms of rent and even in terms of energy use.","words":[["significantly",243.11,244.03],["reduces",244.03,244.99],["costs,",244.99,245.65],["both",246.07,246.33],["in",246.33,246.65],["terms",246.65,246.97],["of",246.97,247.35],["rent",247.35,247.67],["and",247.67,248.63],["even",248.63,248.99],["in",248.99,249.17],["terms",249.17,249.41],["of",249.41,249.65],["energy",249.65,249.89],["use.",249.89,250.37]]},{"start":251.13,"end":256.47,"text":"Employers also argue that an open plan design leads to better teamwork and","words":[["Employers",251.13,251.89],["also",251.89,252.27],["argue",252.27,252.75],["that",252.75,253.03],["an",253.03,253.17],["open",253.17,253.51],["plan",253.51,253.87],["design",253.87,254.33],["leads",254.33,254.91],["to",254.91,255.17],["better",255.17,255.43],["teamwork",255.43,256.03],["and",256.03,256.47]]},{"start":256.47,"end":261.77,"text":"communication. They also feel that new staff can learn from observing other","words":[["communication.",256.47,257.23],["They",257.91,258.39],["also",258.39,258.69],["feel",258.69,259.01],["that",259.01,259.25],["new",259.25,259.63],["staff",259.63,260.05],["can",260.05,260.39],["learn",260.39,260.77],["from",260.77,261.03],["observing",261.03,261.47],["other",261.47,261.77]]},{"start":261.77,"end":267.81,"text":"workers, so this design can actually help in training staff. However, the","words":[["workers,",261.77,262.23],["so",262.71,263.17],["this",263.17,263.43],["design",263.43,263.83],["can",263.83,264.01],["actually",264.01,264.41],["help",264.41,264.95],["in",264.95,265.29],["training",265.29,265.71],["staff.",265.71,266.27],["However,",267.03,267.61],["the",267.71,267.81]]},{"start":267.81,"end":274.75,"text":"complaints voiced by employees seem to suggest that the disadvantages far outweigh the advantages.","words":[["complaints",267.81,268.35],["voiced",268.35,268.93],["by",268.93,269.21],["employees",269.21,269.89],["seem",269.89,270.75],["to",270.75,270.99],["suggest",270.99,271.39],["that",271.39,271.63],["the",271.63,271.77],["disadvantages",271.77,272.69],["far",272.69,273.43],["outweigh",273.43,274.03],["the",274.03,274.11],["advantages.",274.11,274.75]]},{"start":275.57,"end":281.63,"text":"The reality is that unhappy workers are unlikely to work well together, and there is plenty","words":[["The",275.57,275.85],["reality",275.85,276.29],["is",276.29,276.67],["that",276.67,276.83],["unhappy",276.83,277.39],["workers",277.39,277.95],["are",277.95,278.39],["unlikely",278.39,278.79],["to",278.79,279.09],["work",279.09,279.31],["well",279.31,279.51],["together,",279.51,279.91],["and",280.35,280.79],["there",280.79,280.99],["is",280.99,281.17],["plenty",281.17,281.63]]},{"start":281.63,"end":287.81,"text":"of evidence to suggest workers are frequently distracted from their work by the noise that","words":[["of",281.63,281.91],["evidence",281.91,282.29],["to",282.29,282.59],["suggest",282.59,282.97],["workers",282.97,283.51],["are",283.51,283.73],["frequently",283.73,284.39],["distracted",284.39,285.13],["from",285.13,285.49],["their",285.49,285.71],["work",285.71,286.21],["by",286.21,286.91],["the",286.91,287.13],["noise",287.13,287.53],["that",287.53,287.81]]},{"start":287.81,"end":293.89,"text":"is all around them. What is clear is that as designers, we need to think carefully","words":[["is",287.81,287.93],["all",287.93,288.09],["around",288.09,288.41],["them.",288.41,288.69],["What",289.45,289.91],["is",289.91,290.07],["clear",290.07,290.55],["is",290.55,290.89],["that",290.89,291.09],["as",291.09,291.57],["designers,",291.57,292.15],["we",292.51,292.75],["need",292.75,293.01],["to",293.0